{"lines": [{"text": "I've got a new client.", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 0.0, "t1": 1.1, "w0": 0}, {"text": "Great.", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 1.84, "t1": 1.94, "w0": 5}, {"text": "Now I need to find their emails, create a project, send a proposal, track feedback, and remember when to invoice them.", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 2.78, "t1": 9.06, "w0": 6}, {"text": "Where do you manage all of that?", "who": "NOD", "t0": 10.08, "t1": 11.38, "w0": 27}, {"text": "That's the problem.", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 12.0, "t1": 12.86, "w0": 34}, {"text": "Five different places.", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 13.54, "t1": 14.38, "w0": 37}, {"text": "Why not manage the entire client journey in one place?", "who": "NOD", "t0": 15.44, "t1": 18.32, "w0": 40}, {"text": "Can it handle everything from the first inquiry to the final payment?", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 18.96, "t1": 22.24, "w0": 50}, {"text": "Let's follow one client.", "who": "NOD", "t0": 23.1, "t1": 24.46, "w0": 62}, {"text": "A new inquiry comes in. Track the lead, book a discovery call, send your proposal, and follow it through.", "who": "NOD", "t0": 24.98, "t1": 30.4, "w0": 66}, {"text": "And when they accept?", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 31.1, "t1": 31.76, "w0": 85}, {"text": "Your won lead becomes a project. No starting over.", "who": "NOD", "t0": 32.42, "t1": 35.06, "w0": 89}, {"text": "Now share the work with your client through their branded portal. They can review proofs, leave comments, and approve deliverables.", "who": "NOD", "t0": 35.92, "t1": 41.64, "w0": 98}, {"text": "And what happens to all that feedback?", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 42.42, "t1": 43.68, "w0": 118}, {"text": "Turn actionable comments into tasks. Your team handles the revisions, and the feedback stays connected to the original proof.", "who": "NOD", "t0": 44.48, "t1": 50.94, "w0": 125}, {"text": "And what if the client wants more work than we originally agreed?", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 51.76, "t1": 54.66, "w0": 144}, {"text": "Handle scope changes with change orders, so additional work is properly documented.", "who": "NOD", "t0": 55.38, "t1": 59.8, "w0": 156}, {"text": "Projects, tasks, team, calendar, communication, invoices and payments. It's all connected.", "who": "NOD", "t0": 60.82, "t1": 65.12, "w0": 168}, {"text": "So I'm not jumping between five different tools anymore?", "who": "OWNER", "t0": 65.98, "t1": 68.46, "w0": 179}, {"text": "Exactly.", "who": "NOD", "t0": 69.3, "t1": 69.94, "w0": 188}, {"text": "From the first inquiry to the final payment. Run your creative studio with Nodstage.", "who": "NARRATOR", "t0": 71.26, "t1": 75.82, "w0": 189}], "wt": [["I've", 0.0, 0.4], ["got", 0.4, 0.5], ["a", 0.5, 0.62], ["new", 0.62, 0.72], ["client.", 0.72, 1.1], ["Great!", 1.84, 1.94], ["Now", 2.78, 2.98], ["I", 2.98, 3.18], ["need", 3.18, 3.32], ["to", 3.32, 3.44], ["find", 3.44, 3.64], ["their", 3.64, 3.82], ["emails,", 3.82, 4.2], ["create", 4.42, 4.64], ["a", 4.64, 4.82], ["project,", 4.82, 5.2], ["send", 5.52, 5.64], ["a", 5.64, 5.8], ["proposal,", 5.8, 6.2], ["track", 6.54, 6.68], ["feedback,", 6.68, 7.12], ["and", 7.38, 7.5], ["remember", 7.5, 7.88], ["when", 7.88, 8.14], ["to", 8.14, 8.3], ["invoice", 8.3, 8.64], ["them.", 8.64, 9.06], ["Where", 10.08, 10.16], ["do", 10.16, 10.3], ["you", 10.3, 10.42], ["manage", 10.42, 10.74], ["all", 10.74, 11.02], ["of", 11.02, 11.16], ["that?", 11.16, 11.38], ["That's", 12.0, 12.38], ["the", 12.38, 12.5], ["problem.", 12.5, 12.86], ["Five", 13.54, 13.68], ["different", 13.68, 14.02], ["places.", 14.02, 14.38], ["Why", 15.44, 15.64], ["not", 15.64, 15.84], ["manage", 15.84, 16.22], ["the", 16.22, 16.42], ["entire", 16.42, 16.78], ["client", 16.78, 17.24], ["journey", 17.24, 17.52], ["in", 17.52, 17.78], ["one", 17.78, 17.98], ["place?", 17.98, 18.32], ["Can", 18.96, 19.14], ["it", 19.14, 19.26], ["handle", 19.26, 19.6], ["everything", 19.6, 20.08], ["from", 20.08, 20.36], ["the", 20.36, 20.52], ["first", 20.52, 20.78], ["inquiry", 20.78, 21.1], ["to", 21.1, 21.42], ["the", 21.42, 21.56], ["